  "historyNote": "#12639, eff 9-29-18; amd by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13490, eff 11-15-22; ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1009.10) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
